{
  "id": "v-open-altium-designer-cadence-orcad-openscad-task-16-windows",
  "snapshot": "OrCAD-Altium-openscad",
  "instruction": "通过Altium Designer 17.0.6打开提供的本土 `wifi_board.PcbDoc` 建立一个单独的制造板文件. 可以从桌面快捷方式打开Altium Designer; 现在的时间 `C:\\Cadence\\SPB_24.1\\tools\\bin\\Capture.exe` 开放SCAD在 `C:\\Program Files\\OpenSCAD\\openscad.exe`. 写入所需的交付材料 `C:\\Users\\user\\Desktop\\result`. to the Desktop. The panel must contain one Embedded Board Array linked to `wifi_board.PcbDoc` 设置为4行3列,排距11338583毫米,列距13385827毫米,镜子启用,原始模式1. 从该组出口IPC-2581修订B; Altium Designer 17 将本地 XML输出命名为 `wifi_panel.cvg` 提交相同的未修改字节,以所需名称. `wifi_panel.ipc2581`. 两个JSON文件必须总结本地面板对象和IPC-2581步重值.",
  "source": "https://www.altium.com/documentation/altium-designer/ipc-2581-support?version=17.1; https://files.resources.altium.com/sites/default/files/uberflip_docs/file_1179.pdf; https://www.altium.com/documentation/altium-designer/scripting/running-scripts",
